<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink200-kilavi">
       uṭaṉpōkkuntuṇintavaḻi ataṟku iraviṉkaṇ talaimakaṉ vantataṟintatōḻi talaimakaḷaip pāyaluṇarttic colliyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
       Spoken by the confidante, waking up the heroine, who learned that the hero has come in the night, to elope with her [the heroine].</p>
  </div> 
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink200">
<l>ilaṅkuvīṅ kelvaḷai yāynūtal kaviṉap</l>
<l>polantērk koṇkaṉ vantaṉa ṉiṉiyē</l>
<l>vilaṅkari neṭuṅkaṇ ñekiḻmati</l>
<l>nalaṅkavar pacalaiyai nakuka nāmē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>The man from the sea has now come [in his] golden chariot</l>
        <l>So that [your] shining, swollen, bright bangles [and] choice forehead become beautiful!</l>
        <l>Loosen [= open] your long eyes [with] transverse, red lines!</l>
        <l>May we [now] laugh about the pallor that [had earlier] seized your goodness!</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
